ced as a product designation for Christmas figurines by the authorities of the Communist German Democratic Republic, which strove towards the elimination of Christian references in public life. The common German word is Weihnachtsengel (“Christmas angel”), of which “year’s end winged figurine” seems to be a “secularized” version. It has not been proved, however, that this particular name was ever officially used, which makes it more likely to have originated as a popular persiflage.",{"g":"f","decl":"||||en|en|en|en"}]],"senses":[[389448,"jahresendflügelfigur","noun","a figurine of an angel",0,"f",["humorous"]]]},"stornierungsgebühr":{"entries":[["stornierungsgebühr",null,null,"Stornierung + -s- + Gebühr.",{"g":"f","decl":"||||en|en|en|en"}]],"senses":[[676826,"stornierungsgebühr","noun","cancellation fee",0,"f"]]},"verheißenem":{"entries":[["verheißenem",null,null,null]],"senses":[[487247,"verheißenem","adj","strong dative masculine/neuter singular of verheißen",0]],"inflections":[["verheißenem","verheißen","dative,masculine,singular,strong,without-article"]]},"nachzuschlichten":{"inflections":[["nachzuschlichten","nachschlichten","infinitive,infinitive-zu"]]},"stinkfeinen":{"inflections":[["stinkfeinen","stinkfein","genitive,masculine,singular,strong,without-article"]]},"travertins":{"inflections":[["travertins","travertin","genitive"]]},"wiedererlangst":{"inflections":[["wiedererlangst","wiedererlangen","indicative,present,second-person,singular,subordinate-clause"]]},"zerschell":{"inflections":[["zerschell","zerschellen","imperative,second-person,singular"]]}}}